<title>USA: Sandwich, Mass., won by BankBoston.</title>
<headline>Sandwich, Mass., won by BankBoston.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankBoston said it won $3.460 million of Sandwich, Mass., various general obligation municipal purpose loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.003 percent.</p>
</text>
